）のような、夏の学校のプール授業中というシチュエーションで、JC～JKくらいの年齢の子を何人か描いていただけると嬉しいです。\nプールの中にいるところでも、プールサイドで準備運動や休憩しているところでも、更衣室で着替えているところでも、どのようなものでも問題ありません。\n女の子の容姿、スク水の種類、水泳帽の色、ゴーグルの有無などお任せします。\nお引き受けいただけると嬉しいです。\nよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/122044025\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/122427410\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/58864396", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 12, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "おぷーナ", "screen_name": "op_na_ura", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2022337732757037056/5ZzamyG2.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2350122362/1753346915/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 48}, {"id": 2709883, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "永山ゆうのん🐙", "screen_name": "yama913", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1603349568015732736/qyHTj_Hw.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/134337360/1614362326/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 33}, {"id": 2962491, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "大江うさぎ(usagi_oe)🐰Illustrator", "screen_name": "usausagitan", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1104292477521944576/NZfzmdhq.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/3252416352/1719472197/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, 